[ti:Half-Grown Heart]
[ar:Giuntru]
[re:Automatic line alignment - listening review pending]
[00:09.78]I learned to pause before I ran
[00:13.26]Counting steps inside my chest
[00:15.86]Every want was almost mine
[00:18.50]Then something stopped me mid breath
[00:21.16]Hands I never saw held tight
[00:24.08]Not to hurt me just to wait
[00:26.80]I felt the push I felt the pull
[00:29.50]But time wouldn’t change its shape
[00:33.44]I was ready before I knew how
[00:39.82]Leaning forward falling slow
[00:43.72]Every signal said be still
[00:48.60]But my pulse said go
[00:53.04]Half grown heart beating off the line
[00:58.50]Out of rhythm out of time
[01:00.88]I don’t break I don’t restart
[01:03.04]I just live inside this half grown heart
[01:06.54]Half grown heart warm but held apart
[01:09.16]Too awake to play it smart
[01:11.90]Not enough to tear it down
[01:14.02]Not enough to turn around
[01:27.32]I carried softness like a weight
[01:29.86]Kept it hidden in my frame
[01:32.80]Every door looked almost right
[01:35.26]Every touch rehearsed my name
[01:37.96]I wasn’t scared of what I felt
[01:40.68]I was scared of feeling more
[01:43.50]So I learned the art of standing
[01:46.20]With my hand on every door
[01:49.00]If growing up is just a sound
[01:51.74]Mine keeps skipping every bar
[01:54.38]I hear the future getting close
[01:57.10]Then it stops just where we are
[02:00.02]Half grown heart beating off the line
[02:04.18]Out of rhythm out of time
[02:06.74]I don’t break I don’t restart
[02:08.74]I just live inside this half grown heart
[02:12.24]Half grown heart warm but held apart
[02:14.90]Too awake to play it smart
[02:17.58]Not enough to tear it down
[02:19.70]Not enough to turn around
[02:23.08]I was taught to wait my turn
[02:28.80]But no one told my body how
[02:34.10]Every yes arrived too early
[02:39.90]Every now kept saying not now
[02:45.12]I didn’t lose my innocence
[02:50.06]I just folded it too tight
[02:54.38]Still beating still unfinished
[02:59.04]Still awake every night
[03:05.24]Half grown heart still learning time
[03:09.80]Still misreading every sign
[03:12.52]If this isn’t who I am
[03:15.24]It’s who I was becoming then
[03:17.64]Half grown heart soft and scarred
[03:20.86]Never broken never hard
[03:23.26]I don’t need to tear apart
[03:25.32]What kept me breathing
[03:27.02]Half grown heart
[03:36.52]
[03:45.78]I wasn’t late
[03:48.08]I was held
[03:50.76]
